From 93a6a816b3888123d87db025347bdbdb466009eb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: claude-brain <build@claude-brain.invalid>
Date: Tue, 22 Sep 2026 19:36:50 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] registry: add gpt-6-sol and gpt-6-luna to the codex
 team/plus/pro catalogs

Backport of upstream 24303543 ('feat(registry): update model definitions and
bump codex client version to 0.155.0'), restricted to the two new GPT-6 Codex
models in the embedded registry catalog and rebased onto the pinned commit.
claude-brain runs the proxy with --local-model, so a model absent from the
embedded catalog is never registered and every request for it fails with
'unknown provider for model gpt-6-sol'.

Only models.json is touched, and only the fields the pinned schema already
uses: upstream's newer 'native_capabilities' key is omitted because no entry
in the pinned catalog carries it.

Tier membership and metadata match upstream exactly: team, plus and pro.
